Then: entry registry with stable IDs · `scope: {entry: 'von-uexkull-foray'}` primitive · fix `RetrievalOptions.collections` (accepted everywhere, read nowhere), the `FacetedRetrieval` arity bug (TS2554 — the ICP path silently never reranks), `_hooksDerivationDone` one-shot global · implement index-first ordering and **A/B it before default-on**.

